WEBVTT

00:00.620 --> 00:03.820
Hosipitali inafanya maonesho ya picha kuchangisha fedha.

00:03.820 --> 00:06.390
Gharama za mtu kushiriki kwenye maonesho

00:06.390 --> 00:10.810
zimetolewa kama ifuatavyo--5t jumlisha 3,

00:10.810 --> 00:14.610
au 5 mara t jumlisha 3, ambapo t inawakilisha

00:14.610 --> 00:17.320
idadi ya tiketi mtu alizonunua.

00:17.320 --> 00:22.330
Kokotoa mlinganyo ambao t ni sawa na 1, t ni sawa na 8,

00:22.330 --> 00:25.790
na t ni sawa na 10.

00:25.790 --> 00:27.620
Ngoja tufanye hili kwanza

00:27.620 --> 00:31.530
ambapo t ni sawa na 1.

00:31.530 --> 00:33.360
Haya maelezo hapa

00:33.360 --> 00:39.750
yanakuwa-- natumia rangi sawa-- inakuwa 5 mara 1.

00:39.750 --> 00:43.680
5 mara 1 jumlisha 3.

00:43.680 --> 00:47.850
5 mara 1 jumlisha 3, na tunajua mpangilio wa kufanya,

00:47.850 --> 00:50.640
inatakiwa kufanya zidisha kabla ya kujumlisha.

00:50.640 --> 00:54.870
Hii itakuwa 5 mara 1 ni 5 jumlisha 3,

00:54.870 --> 00:59.300
hii ni sawa na 8.

00:59.300 --> 01:02.360
Sasa tufanye t ikiwa ni sawa na 8.

01:02.360 --> 01:07.300
T ikiwa ni sawa na 8, huu mlinganyo unakuwa--

01:07.300 --> 01:16.990
natumia rangi ileile tena-- 5 mara 8 jumlisha 3.

01:16.990 --> 01:19.690
Rangi ya kijani.

01:19.690 --> 01:25.650
Kwa mara nyingine, 5 mara 8 ni 40, na kisha tuna jumlisha 3,

01:25.650 --> 01:28.730
hapo, hivyo hii ni sawa na 43.

01:28.730 --> 01:30.270
Tuna ya mwisho,

01:30.270 --> 01:31.900
ambapo t ni sawa na 10.

01:31.900 --> 01:34.440
Nitatumia rangi ya bluu.

01:34.440 --> 01:36.660
Hivyo tuna 5 mara 10.

01:36.660 --> 01:41.670
Hivyo 5t ni 5 mara 10.

01:41.670 --> 01:43.330
Badala ya t, weka 10 hapo.

01:43.330 --> 01:47.249
5 mara 10 jumlisha 3.

01:47.249 --> 01:49.040
Hapa nimetumia kijani,

01:49.040 --> 01:50.248
ila nadhani umeelewa.

01:50.248 --> 01:52.970
5 mara 10 ni 50.

01:52.970 --> 01:55.310
Tumepata 50, na kisha inatakiwa tujumlishe 3 hapo,

01:55.310 --> 01:58.400
itakuwa ni sawa na 53.

01:58.400 --> 02:00.190
Tumemaliza.
